      DO !","body":"\nPLAYER SPECIFIC :\n\n- SET CARDS BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n-
      SET CARDS COUNT BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n\nSHARED INBETWEEN PLAYERS :\n\n-
      When a card is played this round, ADD IT TO PLAYEDCARDSTHISROUND\n- When a
      card is played, ADD IT TO ALLPLAYEDCARDS\n- When a card is played, ADD IT TO
      CURRENTTRICKPLAYERCARDS with reference to the PLAYER\n- When a player is out
      of cards from a specific color, ADD A REFERENCE TO THIS COLOR TO PLAYERSWHOHAVECUT\n-
      When a card is played, REMOVE ITS COLOR FROM UNPLAYEDCOLOR\n- When a card is
      played, DECREMENT ITS COLOR''S VALUE FROM STRONGESTREMAININGCARDBYCOLOR\n\n\nRESET
      LEADING COLOR : how ?\n\n\n\n","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"807bba9d-73c0-4f2d-a558-d37316c1ad90","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":834.0,"y":416.0},"guid":"9a9722d5-4e09-4a50-8e0d-75dd39cc9aac","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SubgraphUnit","$id":"37"},{"numeric":false,"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":431.0,"y":350.0},"guid":"697d8510-7727-4fbf-9b08-04ee07d3aae5","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Equal","$id":"3579"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Scene","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"strongestRemainingCardByColor","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":4468.0,"y":698.0},"guid":"b187758c-322e-4c58-a4be-2161de7c3872","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"3581"},{"member":{"name":"cardData","parameterTypes":null,"targetType":"CardDisplay","targetTypeName":"CardDisplay","$version":"A"},"defaultValues":{"target":null},"position":{"x":3049.0,"y":1014.0},"guid":"de5ed992-770f-42b7-9ee9-d07028ec05e9","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetMember","$id":"3583"},{"type":"System.Int32","value":{"$content":1,"$type":"System.Int32"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":585.0,"y":-1616.0},"guid":"08cfeed0-4b1c-4d5b-9f20-f4e9cdf0005d","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"3586"},{"SnapToGrid":false,"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":1652.0,"y":667.0},"guid":"648a31eb-62c2-4426-a82b-e89d07759ded","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Community.FlowReroute","$id":"3588"},{"kind":"Scene","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"PlayerHuman","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":-1418.0,"y":687.0},"guid":"d22077af-ae93-43a9-866d-dc71abd15801","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SetVariable","$id":"3590"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Scene","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"trickWinner","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":96.0,"y":-1568.0},"guid":"61cd7666-ba24-412e-87f4-a4e6517ea726","$