      DO !","body":"\nPLAYER SPECIFIC :\n\n- SET CARDS BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n-
      SET CARDS COUNT BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n\nSHARED INBETWEEN PLAYERS :\n\n-
      When a card is played this round, ADD IT TO PLAYEDCARDSTHISROUND\n- When a
      card is played, ADD IT TO ALLPLAYEDCARDS\n- When a card is played, ADD IT TO
      CURRENTTRICKPLAYERCARDS with reference to the PLAYER\n- When a player is out
      of cards from a specific color, ADD A REFERENCE TO THIS COLOR TO PLAYERSWHOHAVECUT\n-
      When a card is played, REMOVE ITS COLOR FROM UNPLAYEDCOLOR\n- When a card is
      played, DECREMENT ITS COLOR''S VALUE FROM STRONGESTREMAININGCARDBYCOLOR\n\n\nRESET
      LEADING COLOR : how ?\n\n\n\n","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"807bba9d-73c0-4f2d-a558-d37316c1ad90","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":833.0,"y":272.0},"guid":"d6acf602-e108-42dd-b5ee-0d2388fa72eb","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SubgraphUnit","$id":"4010"},{"chainable":false,"parameterNames":["name"],"member":{"name":"Find","parameterTypes":["System.String"],"targetType":"UnityEngine.GameObject","targetTypeName":"UnityEngine.GameObject","$version":"A"},"defaultValues":{"%name":{"$content":"PlayerHuman","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":-1673.0,"y":692.0},"guid":"cc42bff5-edd5-4d98-92d7-20e7701ece54","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.InvokeMember","$id":"7549"},{"kind":"Scene","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"CurrentPlayer","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":902.0,"y":-240.0},"guid":"1d8d3a14-9787-4891-a4f3-bca3eb9021bc","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SetVariable","$id":"7553"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Scene","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"trickWinner","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":99.0,"y":-960.0},"guid":"0cac8d19-3e47-4658-9a02-8c8c92d70bd1","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"7555"},{"type":"System.Int32","value":{"$content":0,"$type":"System.Int32"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-172.0,"y":-380.0},"guid":"8364035a-c71c-452d-bf9a-2eb7df143168","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"7557"},{"ignoreCase":false,"options":["PlayerHuman","PlayerAI1","PlayerAI2"],"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":279.0,"y":-1730.0},"guid":"a73f9c75-bb60-4239-a3ea-8d55c66d01d1","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SwitchOnString","$id":"7559"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Scene","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"trumpColor","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":4578.0,"y":798.0},"guid":"baf43b91-bcb1-4e7a-8615-8085e5338807","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.Visu